 "head_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-head\" aria-label=\"Race header\">\n  <div class=\"enc-cd-head__top\">\n    <a class=\"enc-cd-back\" href=\"card.html\"\n       aria-label=\"Back to card\">\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&lsaquo;</span>\n      <span>Card</span>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"enc-cd-racenav\" aria-label=\"Race navigation\">\n      \n        <a class=\"enc-cd-racenav__chev\" href=\"race-6.html\"\n           data-role=\"race-prev\"\n           aria-label=\"Previous race\">&lsaquo;</a>\n      \n      <span class=\"enc-cd-racenav__label\">\n        Race 7<span class=\"enc-cd-racenav__of\">/9</span>\n      </span>\n      \n        <a class=\"enc-cd-racenav__chev\" href=\"race-8.html\"\n           data-role=\"race-next\"\n           aria-label=\"Next race\">&rsaquo;</a>\n      \n    </nav>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"enc-cd-head__title\">Clyde And Co Handicap Stakes (Div I)</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"enc-cd-head__meta\">\n    Bath &middot; \n    17:07\n     &middot; 5f160y\n     &middot; Good to Firm\n     &middot; Class 5\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"enc-cd-head__strip\">\n    \n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip enc-cd-chip--settled\">Settled</span>\n    \n\n    \n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip enc-cd-chip--prize\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__label\">Prize</span>\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__value\">£4,187</span>\n      </span>\n    \n\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-chip enc-cd-chip--field\">\n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__label\">Field</span>\n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__value\">10</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
 "pick_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-pick\" aria-label=\"Your pick\">\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-pick__eyebrow\">Result in</p>\n    \n      <p class=\"enc-cd-pick__title enc-cd-pick__title--muted\">No pick made on this race.</p>\n    \n\n  \n</section>\n",
 "letter_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-letter enc-cd-letter--medium\"\n         aria-label=\"LLaMa's read on this race\">\n  <header class=\"enc-cd-letter__head\">\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦙</span>\n    <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__title-block\">\n      <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__eyebrow\">LLaMa&rsquo;s read</p>\n      <h2 class=\"enc-cd-letter__title\">Predicted 1&mdash;2&mdash;3&mdash;4</h2>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <ol class=\"enc-cd-letter__slots\">\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-1\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥇\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            1st\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">7/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Distant Rumble</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Steaming market move to 7/2, highest deterministic score at 6.43, and Teal&#x27;s yard at 38% in the past fortnight. The contested pace map sets up exactly the race his profile needs.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-2\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥈\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            2nd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">10/3</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Legendsoftheland</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Class drop of three rungs is the biggest concession in the field and the form reads 213132 — consistent and competitive. The cold trainer is the reason he doesn&#x27;t go first.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-3\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥉\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            3rd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">8/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Kiss And Run</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Steaming from 8/1 and Rachel Cook &amp; John Bridger operating at 33% from a small sample — weight drop of 4lb and front-running style could pinch a place before the hot pace catches up.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-4\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            4th\n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">15/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Control Room</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Distance-plus and going-plus flags are the cleanest fit combination outside the top three; consistent placed form (232442) and a 13-day turnaround suggests sharpness.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ol>\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__verdict\">The bet is Distant Rumble to win, 1 unit at 7/2. The conviction sits at medium — the market move and the Teal yard form are strong signals, but Legendsoftheland&#x27;s class drop means this is a genuine two-horse race rather than a foregone conclusion. On Mr Fox&#x27;s pick: The Thames Boatman is a horse I read carefully. The SR of 78 actually leads this field, and the class drop of two rungs is a legitimate positive driver. But The Thames Boatman is drifting — from a 9/2 recent SP to 9/1 today — carrying 13lb more than last time, and Richard Hughes&#x27;s yard is at 17% without a specific positive signal for this runner. The SR advantage is real, but a horse the market is running away from under that kind of weight burden is not where I want to be when Distant Rumble is being backed with conviction and the trainer is operating in one of his hottest spells. Mr Fox&#x27;s read on the class drop is sound; the drift and the weight load are the reasons I don&#x27;t follow him here.</p>\n  \n\n  \n    <a class=\"enc-cd-letter__more\" href=\"https://www.saturday-racing.com/letters/bath-2026-09-29/1707/\">\n      Read the full letter &rarr;\n    </a>\n  \n</section>\n",
